    "retrieved": "2026-08-13",
    "method": "Sum congregations and adherents across every religious-body row whose Tradition cell links to traditions?T=1 (Evangelical Protestant). Same parser as the Iowa county pass; t=1 selects states, t=0 counties."
  },
  "vintageNote": "Corrected vintage (2023-06 file upload / ARDA current). Iowa total adherents = 1,431,349, not the pre-correction 1,427,829. Evangelical Protestant = ARDA Tradition T=1; the USRC workbooks themselves carry NO tradition column, so the evangelical split comes from the ARDA report pages. ARDA groups all bodies into 13 traditions: Evangelical Protestant (T=1), Mainline Protestant, Catholic, Black Protestant, Orthodox, Other, Islam, Judaism, Hinduism, Buddhism, Jehovah's Witnesses, Latter-day Saints, Other Christians.",
  "definitions": {
    "evangelicalAdherents": "Sum of adherents across all religious bodies classified Evangelical Protestant (ARDA tradition T=1) in that state.",
    "evangelicalRate": "evangelicalAdherents / 2020 population, as a percent, one decimal.",
    "adherents": "Total adherents, ALL traditions (general religious adherence)."
  },
