  "caveats": [
    "Congregations without adherent counts: 2791 state-level rows report a congregation count but no adherent figure, covering 27289 congregations nationally (all traditions). Of those, 1896 rows / 22611 congregations are Evangelical Protestant \u2014 11.3% of the 199694 evangelical congregations counted. Those congregations ARE included in evangelicalCongregations but contribute ZERO to evangelicalAdherents, so evangelical adherents (and every rate here) are systematically UNDERSTATED. Per-state magnitude is exposed as evangelicalCongregationsWithoutAdherentCount.",
    "\"Adherents\" is a congregation-reported membership measure, not a survey of belief. A low evangelical rate means few people are counted on the rolls of an evangelical congregation; it is not a measure of how many people hold evangelical convictions.",
    "Tradition assignment is ARDA's, applied at the level of the religious body (denomination), not the individual congregation. Nondenominational congregations are classified Evangelical Protestant by ARDA."
